 \; cycle-1 rejects should resubmit only after addressing the reviews\, wi
 th a change note. Highlights nominations (one page\, Feb 17 AoE\; own or 
 others' already-public papers\, tutorials or panels) stay schedule-only. 
 On 2026-10-31 the OpenReview API showed the cycle-1 submission invitation
  active for any user (opened Oct 22\; due Nov 12 11:59 UTC). Size S from 
 22 papers of 45 submissions plus 14 highlight talks in 2026. Size is an e
 ditorial estimate.
